          "id": "699717e4bd70fda1541079d5",
          "question": "<p>Gravitational force between two point masses \\( m \\) and \\( M \\) separated by a distance \\( r \\) is \\( F \\). Now if a point mass \\( 3m \\) is placed next to \\( m \\), the force on \\( M \\) due to \\( m \\) becomes</p>",
